{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2cf30ad85b0413cda17afff76c34caff75d8c5bbf980818a6e0ec7f3aacdb49a", "ja": "育は公園にいた。メンバーの中で自分が一番\n子どもっぽいと悩み、探しにきた環と桃子に\nつい感情をぶつけてしまう。しかし環は嬉し\nいと言い、桃子と育と、互いの気持ちを話し\n合う。3人に笑顔が戻った。", "zh": "育在公园里。她烦恼着自己是成员中最孩子气的一个，面对前来寻找她的环和桃子，不由得发泄了自己的情绪。然而环说自己很开心，于是桃子、育和环互相诉说了彼此的心情。3人的脸上重新绽放了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a4ab0c36313e757a6566f7ff3bac130467ae76a72d1cbb43403e9365ae4810fb", "ja": "（育が夕方になっても帰宅しないと、お母さんから\n連絡があった。育、どこに行ったんだ……！）", "zh": "（妈妈联系我说，育到了傍晚还没回家。育，你到底去哪儿了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c9da636acfce7b83ba13523c36e875e4526164f653b918a10d5a64e713a41998", "ja": "とにかく、育を探しに行かないと……。\n環、桃子、育の行きそうな場所を教えてくれ！", "zh": "总之，得去找育才行……\n小环、桃子，告诉我育可能会去哪里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "be03c29a1bada4569be09ff4595d4e096ce67966c67240abda72a31d9c8dc2e4", "ja": "わかった！", "zh": "明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1004_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "37d0f7049011c95ddc30d1a3b7dd87c98ac0f1558cdfce2f591304fd652fc9f6", "ja": "育！！\nよかった、こんな所にいたんだな……！", "zh": "育！！太好了，原来你在这种地方啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "f75419c5873238f2decb88fdb2bc4ddbcd135ec18d4e4012433e9a0d19e55c88", "ja": "？　{$P$}さん……\nみんな……？", "zh": "？{$P$}先生……大家……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "1e029c9f56a9427d7555264f0da349356ce6396d8aa2ac6bad9c6753ca647965", "ja": "育～！　心配したぞ！", "zh": "育——！我很担心你啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "2ec1e1141171bb6db1dfa7710fca1a416bd4448e2b9af8882d7a8bc338376a63", "ja": "そうだよ！　スマホに連絡しても、全然出ないし。\n何かあったんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "没错！给你打电话也一直没人接。\n我还以为你是不是遇到什么事了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "bee60dd9786ded6152449e13d9fc554a8dde67a632ba2128a4ef9a25500535b4", "ja": "れんらく……？　あっ、ごめんなさい！\nわたし、考えごとしてて、気づかなかったみたい……。", "zh": "联系……？啊，对不起！\n我刚才在想事情，好像没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a9092df66c940ace15191078c5edb2a651b9893dab355d5372e68e1a689e1edc", "ja": "とにかく、無事でなによりだよ。\nお母さんも心配してたからな。", "zh": "总之，平安无事就好。\n你妈妈也一直很担心你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "cbc305645511303cfbc8975c24048a6c11e7fea7864dccab5d4620ffcb8844c1", "ja": "あっ。おかあさんにまで、心配かけちゃったんだ……。\nわたし……。", "zh": "啊，连妈妈都让她担心了……。\n我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f103833126374f7f3e72a3abb81fe4abba50458ec616c86f3e6d500e4bfc6fed", "ja": "そうだぞ。ちょっと待っててくれ。\n今、お母さんに連絡するから……。", "zh": "是啊。你先等一下。\n我现在就联系你妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "46a1a52ea9ff5fac9596e700fecfc05eaf0bdaf9de5b089cdc6aba9060f4365d", "ja": "（急いでお母さんに電話をかけ、育の無事を伝えた。\nとにかく、何事もなくて良かった……）", "zh": "（赶紧给妈妈打了电话，告诉她育平安无事。\n总之，没出什么事真是太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "d97a7f292c2545dba76993725b590718acaec9ea20cff0bf5923b1e1a9470801", "ja": "もう、本当に心配したんだからね！\n連絡にも気づかないなんて、育らしくないんじゃない？", "zh": "真是的，我真的很担心你啊！\n居然连联系都没注意到，这可不像育会做的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "6e1bf9e6dbb0521b02e653995a5a846bff111dc6c626ba32ad930ef0fc628882", "ja": "……ねえ、桃子ちゃん。\nわたしらしいって、どういうことだと思う？", "zh": "……我说，桃子。\n你觉得“像我”，到底是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "cfa88139486930d3a120162005f2f9b9f5d9b5403d04cf547bba05e35999c4cc", "ja": "え？\n育らしいって、それは……えっと。", "zh": "诶？\n所谓“育的风格”，那个……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "6b16e6e7e1cc999b0f85e20e3f50b497e56b46818a12584cb470c5b74d517b3c", "ja": "育？", "zh": "育？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "9966f21dbde35fb07f6fc1b90c857eea29a4f2da9a780a6ad1689b23feebebc7", "ja": "わたしだって……わたしだって、おかあさんや\n{$P$}さんに心配かけたくなかった。", "zh": "我也……我也根本不想让妈妈和\n{$P$}先生担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "404f1cf31c952a95632fc453fed94efe3fdad29a6e14911a45e8afad9ca574a2", "ja": "小さい子みたいに、めいわくかけて……\n探されたり、したくなかった！", "zh": "像个小孩子一样给人添麻烦……\n还害得大家到处找我，我也不想这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "2e49b7eceed8256071e5ab0a37ee9a040464ec835be37d4bbeb5febd5e04f575", "ja": "でもわたし、わかんないんだもん！　どうしたら\nふたりみたいに、大人っぽくなれるのか……。", "zh": "可是我就是不知道嘛！要怎样才能像你们两个一样，变得成熟一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "38c61b6b2eb47b3fe44b884d7f31f0b1de5af3c8368d987456e89a21ade7ae9c", "ja": "大人っぽい環ちゃんや桃子ちゃんには、\nわたしの気持ちなんて、わかんないよ！", "zh": "成熟的环和桃子，\n根本就不懂我的心情啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "b48b1f521e82c4c94705098e15f28d8e921305d3d52cf17409c7f350578cdb1d", "ja": "……！　あ……。", "zh": "……！　啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "c1a316a67518e1324853a5beaa6c478c66faedeadb338c909f18238cae111cd4", "ja": "育、そういう言い方しちゃダメだぞ！\nももこ、育のこと、すっごく心配してたんだから！", "zh": "育，不可以那样说啦！桃子可是非常担心育的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee9196e20f30b5fc8b21f7cfe3bc1bf45601ba0d4e58231151a4f0436c7cbfe3", "ja": "！　環ちゃん……。", "zh": "！环……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e40797b8db36f4b589600fb7f10345372fff6bea194b38dae26e5010e4550c2", "ja": "環……？", "zh": "环……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "4c1ac63f536c7a33b4d3d0be11a62a7e7fb1f33d5b26f072a7e3d251254467a9", "ja": "でも……今のって、育のホントの気持ちだよね？\nたまき、ちょっとうれしかったぞ！", "zh": "可是……刚才那就是育真正的心情，对吧？\n环刚才有点开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "7805db771da76a936155b9a251a24fe150f541885561d6d7be7afe5fd4d192cf", "ja": "今、育が言ったでしょ？　たまきとももこには、\n育の気持ちなんてわからない、って。", "zh": "刚才育不是说了吗？说环和桃子根本不懂育的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "d253c3f06bbbe810ebe5d9f90ae9f209aca9c1fcbbf5f4021eaf878fbb031488", "ja": "だってたまき、本当にわからなかったから。育が、\nなにか悩んでるみたい、ってことくらいしか……。", "zh": "因为环真的不明白嘛。也只知道育好像在烦恼什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "d303cb2e28f29bab6778df3b3e14d549a9e30c9438df9cb433a7defd0e0a0fa2", "ja": "環ちゃん……。", "zh": "小环……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "254ef44bdb50fb3a3777eec290b0d8155b6a40d178dcdde06f47ff9ffd97c62c", "ja": "たまきには、育の気持ちがわからないけど……\nだから育の気持ち、たまきに教えてほしい！", "zh": "虽然环不明白育的心情……\n所以，请把育的心情告诉环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "6680e54ae8e2b3377846b6d169c7fa531e9c1707acebc393d43b8351c797497a", "ja": "も……桃子も！\n育の気持ち、ちゃんと聞きたい！", "zh": "桃……桃子也是！\n想好好听听育的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "2cdb4603d839754415ddc212d24cf34db77aae9439e06e29a774f8422caae8b4", "ja": "でも、いいの……？　わたし……たぶん、\nすごくイヤなこと、ふたりに言っちゃうよ……。", "zh": "可是，真的可以吗……？我……可能会对你们说出非常过分的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "415068c572819a19f35703c47f5a6f591c42c668c83d80064731643f26b7bca1", "ja": "いい！　たまき、なんでも聞くぞ！", "zh": "好！环，你什么都可以说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "81a97ebc6ddb7b44a60c3f3677b5bf0834ca733d0b40b68d99380e4d9f290d8a", "ja": "桃子も、聞くよ。育がもやもやしてるなら、\nその気持ちも、全部言ってみて。", "zh": "桃子也听。既然小育心里闷闷的，就把你的感受全都说出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1037_p", "source_sha256": "93ed96bd33b161e56152074c52d978247bdfcb9a196af0955b80441bbfe8d04a", "ja": "育。環も桃子も、こう言ってる。\n育の本当の気持ち、言ってみてくれないか？", "zh": "育，环和桃子都是这么说的。能不能把你真正的想法告诉我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "257fa5697ab8e4e7eb5883e238ba0994a3cea803e6912e9fbd609ae26123bff3", "ja": "それがどんな気持ちだとしても、俺はプロデューサー\nとして、ちゃんと聞く。ふたりも、そうだと思うよ。", "zh": "不管是什么样的心情，我都会作为制作人认真听你说。我想，她们两个也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f1c59ab32215e932c8ee80cf6f97a6d7bb1671a3f30644f275659bb52a2c633", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nうん。わかった……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嗯，我知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1040_030iku", "source_sha256": "77cc18443643a51ee0b6475ff7ce6ad33f8f933fab02436aff569d80e43755cc", "ja": "えっと……あのね。どうして環ちゃんは、\nそんなに手足が長くて、スタイルがいいの？とか……。", "zh": "那个……就是，为什么环的手脚那么修长，身材那么好之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "db07a7148ba3f424bcc32c2bc09e1db35493a5c008b2a9b07d9da1fcd63c18e3", "ja": "わたしだって、牛乳ちゃんと飲んでるのに……\nどうして環ちゃんばっかり背がのびるの？とか！", "zh": "我也明明好好喝了牛奶的……\n为什么只有环一直在长高呢？之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1042_040tam", "source_sha256": "09af4cb52d44f7dbf16acbb4168d3d0b4f262ab54462c1d50713a2e47a2fd873", "ja": "どうして……うう～ん。\nたまきにも、なんでかはわからないぞ……。", "zh": "为什么……唔——\n环也不知道为什么呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1043_030iku", "source_sha256": "2c5fb0c840d298cdd2cd6ea8926d9ea40e65824de4cec316633e7344de1bdaaa", "ja": "桃子ちゃんは、お仕事がけいけんほうふだし。\nいつもテキパキしてて、大人っぽくて……ずるい。", "zh": "桃子有很多工作经验。\n做事总是干脆利落，又很成熟……真狡猾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "20c63093ed104d01fababb36fbda32b832e6bc7235a11f316a72fc1603a3e7a8", "ja": "環ちゃんは見た目が大人っぽくて、桃子ちゃんは\n頭がよくて……じゃあ、わたしは……？", "zh": "环看起来很成熟，桃子又很聪明……那我呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "c563ffe63d9d9ff6f884979d2da492c902dacddf981115fed27544411e864b43", "ja": "そう思ったら、どんどん、元気がなくなっちゃって。\n……ふたりが悪いんじゃないのに、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "一想到这些，就越来越没精神了。\n……明明不是你们两个人的错，对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "08e0e8b10a83986fd9ca0504d8fc9f156626206a6ef58d0d054b4648c3bbfd2a", "ja": "（それから、育……いや、3人は、\n一生懸命お互いの気持ちを話し合った）", "zh": "（之后，育……不，3个人，努力地互相倾诉了心情。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "5ac2fc5d54745d9295f983c236bc99d60b4b8313f236447ec3e9def583fa8687", "ja": "（まだまだ、つたない言葉だったけれど。\n今の3人なら、きっと伝わったはずだ……）", "zh": "（虽然说得还不够流利，但现在的3人，一定已经把心意传达给对方了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1049_030iku", "source_sha256": "332f3f2614221c5a949e4ba833b1f7f276c6f6ad173d8c58b91e53572b3effce", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nめいわくかけて、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n给你添麻烦了，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "776c2886f8d44c4be7cde7b8b697467d3541e8ac1e30f5a7a892b3c885925b3b", "ja": "このくらい、なんともないよ。\n……それより、満足いくまで話せたか？", "zh": "这点小事，根本不算什么。  \n……比起这个，你们聊得尽兴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1051_030iku", "source_sha256": "c64a8929536e5ab9b07667f0e10def128429339ae14f6c699a0c7c2d1b395bdf", "ja": "うん！　……環ちゃん、桃子ちゃん。\n話を聞いてくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "嗯！……环、桃子。谢谢你们愿意听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1052_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb920b12139cf898e90fe07527f04016d6d9524052dcbe198d79d9c6e2cb64f4", "ja": "ううん。桃子も、育の本当の気持ちを聞けて、\nその……うれしかったから。", "zh": "不会啦。桃子能听到育的真心话，\n那个……也很开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1053_040tam", "source_sha256": "7dc41ff9a007b99c3ee4e19d78e26aed6409122e123b443025b168b44f840549", "ja": "たまきも！　あ、でも、どうすればいいのかは、\n結局わかんなかったけど……。", "zh": "环也一样！啊，不过，到头来还是不知道该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "a06e1a4fa892c25f1cae0c5a2c463c20d28c5c1827bcb5deb5991b7ef0364e74", "ja": "そうだな。簡単な解決方法はないけど……仲間を\nライバルと感じるのは、決して悪い事じゃないんだ。", "zh": "是啊。虽然没有简单的解决办法……但把伙伴视为竞争对手，绝不是什么坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "d9ac5f7ecf7c40d8dec7c2c8a7ad120351824345fe209bb2026e67f756340d65", "ja": "誰にも、負けたくないっていう気持ち……それは、\nトップアイドルを目指す事にも繋がるだろうから。", "zh": "不想输给任何人的心情……那也和追求顶尖偶像的目标是相通的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1056_049mom", "source_sha256": "09bdf3bdd9667678edb19fb29f763e1854c344220c6c4b9d9c9d4fadf50b9211", "ja": "トップアイドル……。", "zh": "顶级偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1058_040tam", "source_sha256": "e11a72e45e416008b67fe5dc7d94b5780c5645b4d8a24496b9ecb0c891845935", "ja": "そうなんだ。おやぶん、トップアイドルに\nなるのって、難しいことなんだね……。", "zh": "原来是这样。大老板，成为顶级偶像，\n是很难的事情呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1059_p", "source_sha256": "c01865a71a5a4d298e1e051b7795ebe41156a57c1ec361c376da27647aa275ed", "ja": "うん、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1060_030iku", "source_sha256": "914d70e929765a38bb81365547a0e179b5534a8825e55de500fcf0252047cad4", "ja": "でもわたし、話せてすっきりしたよ。\n……結局、子どもっぽいところは見せちゃったけど。", "zh": "不过，我说出来之后感觉轻松多了。\n……结果还是让你看到了我孩子气的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "be6b6b08574ae1d98a9dcc6ac4eae83695e23f8a56e7b9cd8f26af5b5323949a", "ja": "そうかな？　育は、大人でも\nなかなかできない事をしたと思うけどな。", "zh": "是这样吗？育做到了连大人都很难做到的事，我倒是觉得呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1062_030iku", "source_sha256": "9a923fedc9c91f176719fbf721a25252fcd6a00ba28baf34b16e2567c60663aa", "ja": "え……そうなの？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "诶……是这样吗？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1063_p", "source_sha256": "c9946750291330605bc020af94bc0865a9eea9be37561cfebce13130d9273163", "ja": "ああ。環も桃子も、育の変化には気付いてた。けど、\n育が話してくれなかったら、解決できなかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯。环和桃子也注意到了育的变化。不过，要不是育告诉我们，就没法解决了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1064_p", "source_sha256": "fb2bc3173428a03de015248cb467237f18548c9752fbb7d0f76f97ba24e8aaa5", "ja": "育の言葉や行動が、結果的に環をリーダーにしたんだ。\nそれは、すごい事だと思うよ。", "zh": "育说的话和做的事，结果让环成为了队长。我觉得这真的很了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1065_030iku", "source_sha256": "933629beec0ce93952483f9b31a485266c6cd721fd80cc0add94cc6744cbba89", "ja": "わたしが、環ちゃんをリーダーに……。\nそうなんだ……。", "zh": "是我让环成为队长的……  \n原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1066_049mom", "source_sha256": "968afb7258f7918d44b26319c51335227f49a61345d32c9eea42245edd63dc7e", "ja": "うん……そうだね。環、思ったよりは、\nちゃんとリーダーできてるんじゃない？", "zh": "嗯……是啊。环比我想的要更像个称职的队长，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1067_040tam", "source_sha256": "3308468a55ece4bb70ff826748bc8864847f1a8be065571db879494b78881876", "ja": "やった～！　ももこにほめられたぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "太棒啦～！被桃子夸奖了～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0152_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0152_story_05_1068_p", "source_sha256": "2b5f418d4163f8d385d0458b387dd5d5228e51c625dd848d6ab97c08b5fb3d9f", "ja": "（3人の顔に、漸く笑顔が戻った。\n……さあ、明日からまた、始まりだ！）", "zh": "（3人的脸上终于重新露出了笑容。……那么，从明天开始又要重新启程了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
